    <rdfs:comment>Severity level indicating the assessed seriousness of the disruption and its potential or actual operational consequences.Indicates the assessed severity of a disruption and its operational consequences. Allowed values: VeryLow (negligible), Low (minor), Medium (moderate), High (major), Critical (severe).</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:range>
      <rdfs:Datatype>
