    <rdfs:comment>Proportion of total energy consumption that originates from renewable sources (e.g., solar, wind). Expressed as a percentage. renewableEnergyShare → KPI VALUE (interpreted/validated. Represents: computed, validated, or normalized KPI possibly aggregated or adjusted. This represents: analytics / decision layer</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#decimal"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/amal.elgammal/ontologies/2025/3/untitled-ontology-31#EnergyKPI"/>
